<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html id="__vue-email" lang="en" dir="ltr"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><!----></head><body data-id="__vue-email-body" style="background-color:#0f172a;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0;"><table align="center" width="100%" data-id="__vue-email-container" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#1e293b;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #334155;overflow:hidden;padding:32px 28px;"><tbody><tr style="width: 100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" data-id="__vue-email-section" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px;"><tbody><tr><td><img data-id="__vue-email-img" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;margin:0 auto;" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SGC-NOVUS/novuswarden/main/resources/vaultwarden-logo-white.svg" width="180" alt="NovusWarden"></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 data-id="__vue-email-heading" style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#f8fafc;text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px 0;"> New Device Access Detected </h1><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;color:#cbd5e1;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;"> A new device has signed into your NovusWarden account. Details of the session: </p><table align="center" width="100%" data-id="__vue-email-section" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#0f172a;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #334155;margin-bottom:24px;"><tbody><tr><td><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;color:#94a3b8;"><strong style="color:#f1f5f9;">Device Type:</strong> {{device_type}}</p><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;color:#94a3b8;"><strong style="color:#f1f5f9;">IP Address:</strong> {{ip_address}}</p><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;color:#94a3b8;"><strong style="color:#f1f5f9;">Timestamp:</strong> {{datetime}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:16px 0;color:#ef4444;text-align:center;"> If you did not initiate this login, change your master password and deauthorize active sessions in your vault immediately. </p><hr data-id="__vue-email-hr" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#334155;margin:32px 0 20px 0;"><table align="center" width="100%" data-id="__vue-email-section" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;"><tbody><tr><td><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0;color:#94a3b8;"> NovusWarden Control Plane • Enterprise Security by <strong>SGC-NOVUS</strong></p><p data-id="__vue-email-text" style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:8px 0 0 0;color:#64748b;"> This is an automated security transmission. If you did not request this action, please review your account settings immediately. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>
